{"id": "EUVD-2026-105086", "enisaUuid": "99fd9bbd-c6c1-3be7-8b00-68d719aa6bf4", "description": "Configurable Reports block for Moodle (moodle-block_configurablereports) before 5.3.1 contains an sql injection vulnerability in report_sql::prepare_sql() via the filter_var request parameter of viewreport.php. Low-privileged users permitted to view reports using the %%FILTER_VAR%% placeholder can inject subqueries or UNION SELECT to read arbitrary database tables, including user password hashes.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T15:40:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T15:54:21", "baseScore": 6.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/commit/1a9fea4b98b093912c6432ea3705c7b1eff4efc0", "https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/commit/8696899740577559efa274b7a40f3bb4f2b30f32", "https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/releases/tag/5.3.1", "https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/blob/5.2.0/reports/sql/report.class.php#L89-L95", "https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/blob/5.3.0/reports/sql/report.class.php#L108-L128", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/configurable-reports-block-for-moodle-before-5.3.1-sql-injection-via-filter-var"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-113608", "GHSA-7qwj-4vq5-8c2j"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "e4373c9a-901f-3507-bd8a-171a15a19b3c", "product": {"name": "moodle-block_configurablereports", "vendor": {"name": "jleyva"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.3.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "820ddaf9-8e74-358a-ba7d-f85c38c3f4b8", "vendor": {"name": "jleyva"}}], "isExploited": false}